  "bodyHash": "kn8zjTlrXEg=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fmakeship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/slabfish_plush.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/blueprint.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"网站\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fpatreon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p><h3>📖 关于：</h3><p>Blueprint 是一个模组库，旨在使访问大多数 Team Abnormals 模组共享的代码更加容易，但任何人都可以且鼓励使用它！它拥有许多有价值的功能，例如注册表助手、数据同步、各种数据驱动的修改系统、生物群系 API、装饰材料 API、Endimator 动画 API 等等！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3>💻 面向开发者：</h3><p>将 Blueprint 添加到你的模组中非常简单！</p><p>首先，你需要将 Blueprint 添加为依赖项，以便在代码中访问该库。为此，请将以下内容添加到你的 <code>build.gradle</code> 中：</p><pre><code>repositories {\n    maven {\n        url = \"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.teamabnormals.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://maven.teamabnormals.com</a>\"\n    }\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    implementation(\"com.teamabnormals:blueprint:&lt;version&gt;\")\n}</code></pre><p>将 <code>&lt;version&gt;</code> 替换为你希望的 Blueprint 版本，包括所需的 Minecraft 版本。<br>\n例如，<code>1.21.1-8.0.0</code> 会生成 <code>blueprint-1.21.1-8.0.0.jar</code>。</p><p>接下来，你需要在 NeoForge 上将其添加为依赖项，以便你的模组在加载时需要 Blueprint。在你的 <code>neoforge.mods.toml</code> 文件中，添加以下代码块：</p><pre><code>[[dependencies.&lt;modId&gt;]]\n    modId = \"blueprint\"\n    type = \"required\"\n    versionRange = \"[&lt;version&gt;,)\"\n    ordering = \"AFTER\"\n    side = \"BOTH\"</code></pre><p>将 <code>&lt;version&gt;</code> 替换为你希望的 Blueprint 版本。<br>\n例如，<code>8.0.0</code> 将定位到 Blueprint 的 <code>8.0.0</code> 版本。<br>\n上述用于 <code>neoforge.mods.toml</code> 文件的代码块将定位所选的版本及之后的任何版本。如果你想要不同的定位方式，建议阅读 <code>neoforge.mods.toml</code> 规范。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fabnormals_delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fallurement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fatmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fautumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fberry_good\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fboatload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fbuzzier_bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fcaverns_and_chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fclayworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fendergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fincubation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/incubation.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fneapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/neapolitan.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fpersonality\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/personality.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fpet_cemetery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/pet_cemetery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fsavage_and_ravage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/savage_and_ravage.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fupgrade_aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/upgrade_aquatic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fwoodworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/woodworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n</p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fnodecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/nodecraft.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
